---
/**
 * Compact "this is who the folio is for" chip — Flow C on /admin/nuevo,
 * once a patient is already chosen (`?patient=ID`), replaces the name/
 * birth date/phone fields so the employee is not asked to retype data the
 * system already has.
 *
 * Static markup only; /admin/nuevo's script fills in the name and phone
 * and wires "Cambiar" once it has fetched GET /patients/:id.
 */
---

<div class="card" id="patient-chip" hidden>
  <span class="pavatar" id="chip-initials" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="card__body">
    <p class="card__title" id="chip-name"></p>
    <p class="card__meta" id="chip-phone"></p>
  </div>
  <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" href="/admin/buscar" id="chip-change">Cambiar</a>
</div>
